{"id":"target","name":"Target","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:target"],"types":[],"standing":"single-index","indexes":["nave"],"thin":false,"groups":["Made"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Target","text":"(1 Sam. 17:6, A.V., after the LXX. and Vulg.), a kind of small shield. The margin has “gorget,” a piece of armour for the throat. The Revised Version more correctly renders the Hebrew word (kidon) by “javelin.” The same Hebrew word is used in Josh. 8:18 (A.V., “spear;” R.V., “javelin”); Job 39:23 (A.V., “shield;” R.V., “javelin”); 41:29 (A.V., “spear;” R.V., “javelin”)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H6793","lemma":"צִנָּה","xlit":"tsinnâh","gloss":"a hook","kjv":"buckler, cold, hook, shield","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H3967","lemma":"מֵאָה","xlit":"mêʼâh","gloss":"a hundred","kjv":"hundred, -th), sixscore","count":3,"share":0.75}],"verses":["1Kgs.10.16","2Chr.9.15","2Chr.14.8","1Sam.17.6"],"witnesses":["n","n","n","n"],"agreed":0,"broader":[],"narrower":[],"related":[{"id":"shield","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"shield","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.077,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"shield","type":"lexical","strong":"H6793","why":"both lead with צִנָּה (H6793)"},{"id":"shields","type":"lexical","strong":"H6793","why":"both lead with צִנָּה (H6793)"},{"id":"azgad","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"longevity","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"maneh","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"parosh","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"pashur","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"pharosh","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"}],"works":[{"work":"philo","title":"The Works of Philo Judaeus","count":2,"chapters":[{"chapter